// ==========================================================================
// KPI Display Selected
// Model folder: 10 - Parameters & Helpers / 10.2 - Slicer & Parameters
// --------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Purpose: The value behind the selected KPI.
// Why it exists: Title and value resolved from the same parameter, so they
// can never disagree.
// ==========================================================================

VAR vValue = [KPI Value Selected]
VAR vArrow = [KPI Arrow Selected]
VAR vDelta = [KPI Delta PM Selected]
RETURN
    FORMAT ( vValue, "#,##0.0,,M" )
        & " "
        & vArrow
        & " "
        & FORMAT ( vDelta, "0.0%" )
